{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "reentrancy/a-post-replayed-from-the-room-s-work-draws-no-pass",
  "title": "A post replayed from the room's work is read before the reentry budget: twelve posts with one key past a budget of ten return the first, and a new post still has its pass",
  "rules": [
    "§10.5 The host's own voice",
    "§13.4",
    "§9.5.1",
    "§8.3 Reentry cap"
  ],
  "requirements": [
    "RK-10.5-041",
    "RK-13.4-009"
  ],
  "reentrancy": [
    "inject@locked",
    "inject@admitted"
  ],
  "notes": "max_chain_depth is 1, so the cascade's budget is 10 passes. A locked hook (room-1) and an off-lock hook (room-2) on sms's message each post twelve times with one key, then once with none. The first post attaches the host channel from within the room's work; each replay returns it, read before the budget and drawing nothing, so the new post still has its pass. Drawn by the replays, the budget would be spent by the tenth post and the last ones stored BLOCKED.",
